The attention kernel is generated from the gfx120x FP8 flash attention kernel in FlyDSL pull request
#1223 ("Add gfx120x RDNA4 wave32 ops", head commit 59219efcc3c9a780bf080af811048f95081bc8f3, an unmerged
draft at the time of building) by the transforms in kernel_build/make_sage*.py. The compiled code objects in
src/rdna4_sage/kernels were produced from that source with FlyDSL and Triton.

The quantization scheme follows the SageAttention2 design (int8 Q K^T, fp8 P V; https://github.com/thu-ml/SageAttention);
no SageAttention code is included.
